[36m(TaskRunner pid=3717577)[0m \[ b = \frac{7(8 - 1)}{9 - 8} = \frac{7 \cdot 7}{1} = 49 \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3717577)[0m 2. If \( 9 - k = -1 \), then \( k = 10 \). Substituting \( k = 10 \) into the equation, we get:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3717577)[0m \[ b = \frac{7(10 - 1)}{9 - 10} = \frac{7 \cdot 9}{-1} = -63 \] (not a valid base)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3717577)[0m 3. If \( 9 - k = 7 \), then \( k = 2 \). Substituting \( k = 2 \) into the equation, we get:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3717577)[0m \[ b = \frac{7(2 - 1)}{9 - 2} = \frac{7 \cdot 1}{7} = 1 \] (not a valid base)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3717577)[0m 4. If \( 9 - k = -7 \), then \( k = 16 \). Substituting \( k = 16 \) into the equation, we get:
